(SAMPLE RULE DEFINITIONS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GROWTH-G-001 - Commitment direction) Tj
T*
(Measure: commitment_change_pct) Tj
T*
(Favorable: value greater than 0 percent.) Tj
T*
(Neutral: value equal to 0 percent within the approved rounding tolerance.) Tj
T*
(Attention: value less than 0 percent.) Tj
T*
(Explanation: compares flexible-term commitment with the uniform 3-year reference.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GROWTH-G-002 - NPV direction) Tj
T*
(Measure: npv_change) Tj
T*
(Favorable: value greater than or equal to 0.) Tj
T*
(Attention: value less than 0.) Tj
T*
(Explanation: uses the configured annual discount rate and straight-line proxy.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CUSTOMER-CV-001 - Term choice) Tj
T*
(Measure: flexible_adoption_pct) Tj
T*
(Report the selected flexible-deal share; do not label a higher share as better.) Tj
T*
(Explanation: term choice is a proxy until direct customer outcomes are available.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CUSTOMER-CV-002 - Expected term) Tj
T*
(Measure: average_term_years) Tj
T*
(Report direction against 3 years without assigning positive or negative sentiment.) Tj
T*
